    "title": "Do you recognize this theft suspect at the Eight Mile ABC store? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "PRICHARD, Ala. ( WKRG ) — The Prichard Police Department is asking for the public’s help in identifying a man connected to a string of thefts at the ABC store in Eight Mile. According to a release from PPD, the suspect stole multiple bottles and cases of liquor on several different occasions between June and July 2025. The stolen alcohol’s total value exceeds $300. Investigators are working to identify the individual who “appears to have acted alone during each incident.” If you recognize the suspect, please contact the Prichard Police Department at (251)-452-2211. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WKRG News 5.",
